msgid ""
"This dialog allows you to adjust your individual pad borders.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Each pad model differs in size; here, we determine the custom values for "
"your pad.<br>\n"
"Follow the given instructions and click <b>Next</b> to proceed."
